### List users
GET http://localhost:3003/users HTTP/1.1

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:3003/users/1 HTTP/1.1

### Regester user
POST http://localhost:3003/api/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "piotr@user.com",
    "password": "securepassword"
}

